<title>SLOVENIA: SOCCER-SLOVENIAN CUP FINAL FIRST LEG GOALLESS.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-SLOVENIAN CUP FINAL FIRST LEG GOALLESS.</headline>
<dateline>AJDOVSCINA, Slovenia 1997-06-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Primorje Ajdovscina and Maribor Branik drew 0-0 in the first leg of the Slovenian Cup final on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The second leg will be played in Maribor on June 11.</p>
</text>
